<title>NORWAY: PGS H1 pre-tax profit rises 53 pct.</title>
<headline>PGS H1 pre-tax profit rises 53 pct.</headline>
<dateline>OSLO 1997-07-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30.</p>
<p>			    (millions of $ unless stated)</p>
<p>  Net revenues	    233.1    vs	192.1</p>
<p>  Operating profit	 50.3    vs	 33.0</p>
<p>  Pre-tax income	   38.6    vs	 25.3</p>
<p>  Net income		 24.1    vs	 17.7</p>
<p>  Earnings per share H1 ($)   0.74     vs     0.66</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of Norwegian offshore services and seismic company is Petroleum Geo-Services ASA (PGS). PGS is headquartered in Houston, Texas. A Reuters poll of seven analysts forecast an operating result of $44 million and pre-tax profits of $35 million.</p>
<p>--Oslo newsroom, +47 22 42 50 41</p>
</text>
